  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Crafting the Homepage**\n\nI\'m now laser-focused on meticulously crafting the homepage. The goal is a clean, editorial layout, sharp typography, delicate borders, ample whitespace, and absolutely zero AI artifacts. Adherence to the prompt\'s guidelines is paramount. The first page to design will be `src/pages/HomePage.tsx`.\n\n\n**Defining the Homepage Content**\n\nI\'ve moved on to defining the actual content for the homepage. I\'m thinking of an eyebrow with project and course context, a headline like \"Making technology easier for everyone,\" and a concise description. The primary CTA is \"Start Learning \342\206\222\" leading to modules, and a secondary \"Explore Online Safety\" CTA to the safety section. I\'m planning an asymmetric layout with a right-hand visual. I\'m envisioning an editorial mockup with line art or SVG to show digital literacy in practice and structured product cards. There will be an editorial grid with four categorized modules: Digital Basics, Digital Payments, Online Safety, and Digital Services.\n\n\n"
