        lines {
          text: "      desc: \'Think of UPI as a digital courier system built by the National Payments Corporation of India (NPCI). Instead of sharing your 16-digit bank account number and IFSC code, UPI lets you transfer money directly between bank accounts instantly using just a phone number, QR code, or simple UPI ID (like name@upi).\',"
