        lines {
          text: "          <p className=\"text-sm text-[#525252] leading-relaxed\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "            Think of UPI as a digital courier system built by the National Payments Corporation of India (NPCI). Instead of sharing your 16-digit bank account number and IFSC code, UPI lets you transfer money directly between bank accounts instantly using just a <strong>phone number</strong>, <strong>QR code</strong>, or simple <strong>UPI ID</strong> (like <code className=\"text-[#171717] font-semibold\">name@upi</code>)."
