        lines {
          text: "      definition: \'Scammers offer high daily payouts (e.g. \342\202\2713,000\342\200\223\342\202\2718,000/day) for simple tasks like liking YouTube videos, rating Google Maps locations, or hotel reviews on Telegram.\',"
