  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the full multilingual localization and visual refinement for **Digital Saathi**, implementing complete support for **English**, **Hindi (\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\246\340\245\200)**, and **Marathi (\340\244\256\340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\240\340\245\200)** across the entire application:\n\n- **Complete Multi-Language Localization**:\n  - **Navigation & Controls**: Dynamic language toggle (`EN` / `HI` / `MR`) that instantly translates all navigation links, search placeholders, buttons, and mobile drawer items.\n  - **Interactive Scam Spotter Simulator**: All 5 real-world scam scenarios (Fake Bank KYC, Electricity Cutoff SMS, Lottery Link, Remote Screen Share App, and Part-Time Job Scam) feature authentic, natural phrasing in English, Hindi, and Marathi along with localized red flag highlights and rationale.\n  - **Core Educational Modules**:\n    - **01. Digital Basics**: Touch gestures, volume control, Wi-Fi & cellular data, safe Play Store installations, and app permission audits.\n    - **02. UPI & Safe Payments**: Fundamentals of UPI, 7-step payment guide, QR code verification, and the Golden Rule: *Entering your UPI PIN only sends money; receiving money never requires a PIN*.\n    - **03. Online Safety & Fraud Prevention**: Phishing SMS identification, OTP confidentiality, fake search engine customer care numbers, 1930 Cyber Crime Helpline Golden Hour protocol, and the categorized DOs and DON\'Ts checklist.\n    - **04. Digital Public Services**: Official DigiLocker setup guide, Masked Aadhaar identity privacy guidelines, and distinguishing verified `.gov.in` / `.nic.in` domains from cloned fraud websites.\n  - **Interactive 10-Question Knowledge Quiz**: Fully translated questions, options, immediate feedback, and scoring summaries tailored to the active language.\n  - **Project Manifesto (About Page)**: Localized overview of the 3rd-Year B.Sc. Computer Science Community Engagement Project (CEP) on the theme *\342\200\234Building Open-Source Solutions for Social Problems.\342\200\235*\n  - **Multilingual Search Modal**: Instant keyword search supporting queries in English, Hindi, and Marathi with localized topic summaries.\n  - **Structured Footer**: Localized 1930 Cyber Helpline quick-dial banner, curriculum directory, and open-source project credits."
    thinking: "**Verifying Requirements Achieved**\n\nI\'ve confirmed both linting and compilation were successful. Now I\'m meticulously verifying all requirements are met. Specifically, I\'ve removed the legacy font scaling section as instructed. Also, I\'ve implemented comprehensive multilingual support, focusing on English, Hindi (\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\246\340\245\200), and Marathi (\340\244\256\340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\240\340\245\200) translation and localization. This spans all components.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the full multilingual localization and visual refinement for **Digital Saathi**, implementing complete support for **English**, **Hindi (\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\246\340\245\200)**, and **Marathi (\340\244\256\340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\240\340\245\200)** across the entire application:\n\n- **Complete Multi-Language Localization**:\n  - **Navigation & Controls**: Dynamic language toggle (`EN` / `HI` / `MR`) that instantly translates all navigation links, search placeholders, buttons, and mobile drawer items.\n  - **Interactive Scam Spotter Simulator**: All 5 real-world scam scenarios (Fake Bank KYC, Electricity Cutoff SMS, Lottery Link, Remote Screen Share App, and Part-Time Job Scam) feature authentic, natural phrasing in English, Hindi, and Marathi along with localized red flag highlights and rationale.\n  - **Core Educational Modules**:\n    - **01. Digital Basics**: Touch gestures, volume control, Wi-Fi & cellular data, safe Play Store installations, and app permission audits.\n    - **02. UPI & Safe Payments**: Fundamentals of UPI, 7-step payment guide, QR code verification, and the Golden Rule: *Entering your UPI PIN only sends money; receiving money never requires a PIN*.\n    - **03. Online Safety & Fraud Prevention**: Phishing SMS identification, OTP confidentiality, fake search engine customer care numbers, 1930 Cyber Crime Helpline Golden Hour protocol, and the categorized DOs and DON\'Ts checklist.\n    - **04. Digital Public Services**: Official DigiLocker setup guide, Masked Aadhaar identity privacy guidelines, and distinguishing verified `.gov.in` / `.nic.in` domains from cloned fraud websites.\n  - **Interactive 10-Question Knowledge Quiz**: Fully translated questions, options, immediate feedback, and scoring summaries tailored to the active language.\n  - **Project Manifesto (About Page)**: Localized overview of the 3rd-Year B.Sc. Computer Science Community Engagement Project (CEP) on the theme *\342\200\234Building Open-Source Solutions for Social Problems.\342\200\235*\n  - **Multilingual Search Modal**: Instant keyword search supporting queries in English, Hindi, and Marathi with localized topic summaries.\n  - **Structured Footer**: Localized 1930 Cyber Helpline quick-dial banner, curriculum directory, and open-source project credits."
