    response: "I have updated the **Digital Basics** module with comprehensive guidance on **Device PIN & Password Hygiene** and **SIM Card Lock & Eject Theft Protection**, fully localized across English, Hindi, and Marathi.\n\n### Key Enhancements Implemented:\n\n- **Phone Screen Lock & PIN Hygiene (Why Weak PINs Fail)**:\n  - **Predictable PIN Breakdown**: Detailed dangerous patterns to avoid, including sequential digits (`1234`, `4321`), repeated digits (`0000`, `9999`), birth years (`1985`, `2002`), straight keypad lines (`2580`), vehicle numbers, and the last 4 digits of the user\'s mobile number.\n  - **The Threat Explained**: Clarified how thieves examine lost wallets, Aadhaar cards, and IDs to test birth years on lock screens, gaining immediate access to banking and UPI applications.\n  - **Golden Rules**: Guidance on setting 6-digit random PINs, enabling biometric fingerprint/face recognition, and setting a 30-second screen lock timer.\n\n- **SIM Card Lock & Eject Theft Protection**:\n  - **The Physical Ejection Vector**: Explained why a screen lock alone is not enough \342\200\224 thieves can eject a SIM card with a paperclip/safety pin, place it in another phone, and intercept Bank OTPs to reset UPI PINs.\n  - **The SIM Lock Defense**: Step-by-step setup guides for both **Android** (`Settings > Security > SIM Card Lock`) and **iPhone** (`Settings > Cellular > SIM PIN`) requiring a 4-digit PIN every time the SIM is ejected or rebooted.\n  - **Telecom Default PIN & PUK Advice**: Clear warnings to replace default telecom PINs (`0000`/`1234`) and how to securely locate the 8-digit PUK code in carrier apps (Airtel Thanks, MyJio, Vi App) to keep in a home notebook.\n\n- **Multilingual Support & Search Indexing**:\n  - All advice, step-by-step instructions, and warning callouts are translated into natural **Hindi** and **Marathi**.\n  - Updated the global search database so users searching for *\"SIM lock\"*, *\"PIN\"*, *\"\340\244\252\340\244\276\340\244\270\340\244\265\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\241\"*, or *\"\340\244\270\340\244\277\340\244\256 \340\244\232\340\245\213\340\244\260\340\245\200\"* find these modules instantly."
