  planner_response {
    response: "I have added direct **YouTube Video Tutorial & Official Awareness Guides** across all core sections and the homepage.\n\n### What Has Been Implemented:\n\n- **Curated Video Guide Component (`VideoGuideSection`)**:\n  - Direct links with **\"Watch on YouTube\"** action buttons that launch verified channels in a new tab.\n  - Institutional source verification tags (e.g. **Reserve Bank of India**, **Ministry of Home Affairs - Cyber Dost**, **NPCI Official**, **UIDAI Official**, and **Digital India**).\n  - Duration indicators and multi-language support (**English, Hindi, and Marathi**).\n\n- **Section-by-Section YouTube Video Integration**:\n  1. **Digital Basics (`/basics`)**:\n     - *How to Enable SIM Card Lock PIN (Android & iPhone)* \342\200\224 4-digit SIM PIN setup to stop physical SIM ejection and OTP theft.\n     - *Setting Strong Screen Lock PIN & Fingerprint Security* \342\200\224 Replacing predictable PINs with biometrics.\n     - *Google Play Protect & Checking App Permissions Safely* \342\200\224 Malware scanning and revoking dangerous SMS permissions.\n  2. **Digital Payments & UPI (`/payments`)**:\n     - *RBI Kehta Hai: UPI PIN is ONLY for Debiting Money* \342\200\224 Official RBI awareness against PIN-for-receiving scams.\n     - *NPCI Official: How to Scan & Pay Safely with UPI QR Codes* \342\200\224 Recipient verification before typing PIN.\n     - *Exposing Fake QR Code & Payment Request Scams* \342\200\224 Live fraud demonstration.\n  3. **Cyber Safety & Scam Defense (`/safety`)**:\n     - *How to Report Online Fraud on 1930 & Cybercrime.gov.in* \342\200\224 Ministry of Home Affairs golden hour freezing workflow.\n     - *Beware of Screen-Sharing Scams (AnyDesk, TeamViewer)* \342\200\224 Exposing fake customer care remote access.\n     - *Fake Electricity Bill & Bank KYC SMS Scams Explained* \342\200\224 Recognizing urgency traps.\n  4. **Public Services & DigiLocker (`/services`)**:\n     - *DigiLocker Step-by-Step Tutorial* \342\200\224 Adding Driving License, RC, and official marksheets.\n     - *Downloading Masked Aadhaar Card from UIDAI Portal* \342\200\224 Hiding first 8 digits for non-statutory verification.\n     - *UMANG App Portal Guide* \342\200\224 Accessing EPFO, pension, and state services in one unified app.\n  5. **Home Dashboard (`/`) & Search**:\n     - Added a **Featured Video Tutorials Spotlight** on the main page and indexed all video guides in the global search modal."
    modified_response: "I have added direct **YouTube Video Tutorial & Official Awareness Guides** across all core sections and the homepage.\n\n### What Has Been Implemented:\n\n- **Curated Video Guide Component (`VideoGuideSection`)**:\n  - Direct links with **\"Watch on YouTube\"** action buttons that launch verified channels in a new tab.\n  - Institutional source verification tags (e.g. **Reserve Bank of India**, **Ministry of Home Affairs - Cyber Dost**, **NPCI Official**, **UIDAI Official**, and **Digital India**).\n  - Duration indicators and multi-language support (**English, Hindi, and Marathi**).\n\n- **Section-by-Section YouTube Video Integration**:\n  1. **Digital Basics (`/basics`)**:\n     - *How to Enable SIM Card Lock PIN (Android & iPhone)* \342\200\224 4-digit SIM PIN setup to stop physical SIM ejection and OTP theft.\n     - *Setting Strong Screen Lock PIN & Fingerprint Security* \342\200\224 Replacing predictable PINs with biometrics.\n     - *Google Play Protect & Checking App Permissions Safely* \342\200\224 Malware scanning and revoking dangerous SMS permissions.\n  2. **Digital Payments & UPI (`/payments`)**:\n     - *RBI Kehta Hai: UPI PIN is ONLY for Debiting Money* \342\200\224 Official RBI awareness against PIN-for-receiving scams.\n     - *NPCI Official: How to Scan & Pay Safely with UPI QR Codes* \342\200\224 Recipient verification before typing PIN.\n     - *Exposing Fake QR Code & Payment Request Scams* \342\200\224 Live fraud demonstration.\n  3. **Cyber Safety & Scam Defense (`/safety`)**:\n     - *How to Report Online Fraud on 1930 & Cybercrime.gov.in* \342\200\224 Ministry of Home Affairs golden hour freezing workflow.\n     - *Beware of Screen-Sharing Scams (AnyDesk, TeamViewer)* \342\200\224 Exposing fake customer care remote access.\n     - *Fake Electricity Bill & Bank KYC SMS Scams Explained* \342\200\224 Recognizing urgency traps.\n  4. **Public Services & DigiLocker (`/services`)**:\n     - *DigiLocker Step-by-Step Tutorial* \342\200\224 Adding Driving License, RC, and official marksheets.\n     - *Downloading Masked Aadhaar Card from UIDAI Portal* \342\200\224 Hiding first 8 digits for non-statutory verification.\n     - *UMANG App Portal Guide* \342\200\224 Accessing EPFO, pension, and state services in one unified app.\n  5. **Home Dashboard (`/`) & Search**:\n     - Added a **Featured Video Tutorials Spotlight** on the main page and indexed all video guides in the global search modal."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
