  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Component References**\n\nI\'m now focusing on specific components: `BasicsPage.tsx`, `PaymentsPage.tsx`, `SafetyPage.tsx`, `ServicesPage.tsx`, `AboutPage.tsx`, `Footer.tsx`, and `SearchModal.tsx`. These are the targets. The goal is a focused review for design enhancements.\n\n\n**Establishing Visual Harmony**\n\nI\'m now implementing the design system across the components, focusing on the visual palette. I\'m settling on a warm background and deep charcoal for primary text, with muted neutrals for secondary text. I\'m going with a crisp divider and a deep calming teal as a primary accent. I\'m also ensuring appropriate status colors for safe, cautious, and warning states, and staying away from flashy effects.\n\n\n**Implementing Accessibility Features**\n\nI\'ve got the text size scaling system implemented using `A-`, `A`, and `A+` buttons, which smoothly increases font sizes across the app. Generous line-height and letter-spacing are now applied, with large touch targets. The navigation bar features clearly labeled links, accessible text size controls, and full-text language options for ease of use. I\'m prioritizing high-contrast and big touch targets for easy navigation.\n\n\n**Designing Homepage UX**\n\nI\'m now iterating on the homepage content for a user-centric design. The headline focuses on accessibility, translating into Hindi and Marathi. The goal is clear: the main CTA is to start learning, supported by intuitive intent cards. I\'m prioritizing a clean, non-overwhelming structure with a Scam Spotter feature. I\'ve got a strong structure ready.\n\n\n**Developing Educational Content**\n\nI\'m now integrating educational content into the revised pages. I\'m focusing on a realistic SMS scenario, alongside curated YouTube tutorials and a knowledge quiz banner. I\'m also working on the Digital Basics Page, with visually numbered steps for seniors and beginners, emphasizing screen lock security, SIM card safety, and app permissions. The Digital Payments page will have prominent high-contrast warnings about UPI PINs, OTPs, and recipient verification, and an interactive scan-and-pay simulator.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 507239777
    }
